Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:18.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Kartal waltzes into the Wuhan final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡塔尔闯进了武汉决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:22.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Her big moment in a 1000 arrives.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的一千赛高光时刻来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}An outstanding victory.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一场了不起的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.18,TL,,0,0,0,,排名第{\fs78}170{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:31.14,TL,,0,0,0,,这个数字说的不是她的水平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:33.33,TL,,0,0,0,,是她停下来的那半年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:36.17,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:37.91,TL,,0,0,0,,卡塔尔连赢两个抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:39.73,TL,,0,0,0,,淘汰了奥斯塔彭科
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:42.52,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}个月前 她因为背伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.99,0:00:45.64,TL,,0,0,0,,她在布莱顿长大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:48.20,TL,,0,0,0,,从小到大 她最常碰到的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:49.88,TL,,0,0,0,,叫拉杜卡努
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.49,0:00:54.12,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2011{\fs68}年 英国{\fs78}10{\fs68}岁以下组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:55.07,TL,,0,0,0,,两个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.07,0:00:57.37,TL,,0,0,0,,打出了一个停不下来的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.37,0:00:59.46,TL,,0,0,0,,后来 一个拿了美网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.46,0:01:01.60,TL,,0,0,0,,一个还在一场一场地打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.77,0:01:05.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Emma and I, we grew up playing each other,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我和艾玛从小就是对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.87,0:01:08.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}kind of from mini tennis.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从迷你网球就开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:11.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I've got an older brother, he's five years older than me,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我有个哥哥 比我大五岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:14.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and he used to play just for fun.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他打球只是为了好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.55,0:01:17.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And my parents used to take me up to the club,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N爸妈带我去俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.71,0:01:20.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I used to just sit on the grass and watch him play.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我就坐在草地上看他打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:22.59,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's how it all began.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一切就是这么开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:25.26,TL,,0,0,0,,她个子不高 靠的是脚步和耐心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:27.21,TL,,0,0,0,,把一个又一个球救回去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:28.09,TL,,0,0,0,,她的排名
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.09,0:01:30.65,TL,,0,0,0,,也是这么一场一场打上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.69,0:01:33.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年温网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:35.56,TL,,0,0,0,,排名{\fs78}295{\fs68}的她
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.56,0:01:37.53,TL,,0,0,0,,从资格赛打进第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:40.22,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}27{\fs68}年来 英国女子资格赛球员里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:42.13,TL,,0,0,0,,她是第一个做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.45,0:01:56.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's done it! Sonay Kartal's dream run continues.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她做到了！卡塔尔的梦还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.99,0:02:01.42,TL,,0,0,0,,那年秋天 她拿到生涯第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:03.05,TL,,0,0,0,,进了世界前{\fs78}100{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.05,0:02:05.91,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年 她又回到温网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:15.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the show does go on, a straight-sets victory,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好戏继续 直落两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.47,0:02:21.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}into the fourth round of a Grand Slam for the very first time in her career,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N生涯第一次打进大满贯第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:22.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and she's done it on the grass of Wimbledon.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就在温网的草地上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.51,0:02:28.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It doesn't matter if I'm playing number one in the world or 300 in the world,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不管对面是世界第一还是第三百
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.61,0:02:30.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm still gonna respect that opponent.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我都会尊重对手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:32.43,TL,,0,0,0,,同年秋天的北京
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.43,0:02:33.79,TL,,0,0,0,,世界第{\fs78}81{\fs68}的她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.79,0:02:36.60,TL,,0,0,0,,对上世界第{\fs78}5{\fs68}的米拉 安德烈耶娃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:37.64,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘打满
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:40.19,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她生涯最大的一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.51,0:02:55.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's out! Sonay Kartal has caused another seismic event in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N出界！卡塔尔在北京又掀起一场地震
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.31,0:03:05.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The world number 81 defeats Mirra Andreeva, the number four seed.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第{\fs78}81{\fs68}击败{\fs78}4{\fs68}号种子安德烈耶娃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.39,0:03:07.07,TL,,0,0,0,,今年{\fs78}3{\fs68}月的印第安维尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.07,0:03:08.24,TL,,0,0,0,,背已经开始疼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:09.99,TL,,0,0,0,,她还是逆转了凯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:11.99,TL,,0,0,0,,赛后她说 正是这样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.99,0:03:14.35,TL,,0,0,0,,打出了她身上的斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.89,0:03:20.07,TL,,0,0,0,,两天后的第四轮 她撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:22.67,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}落后时退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:24.44,TL,,0,0,0,,背部应力性骨折
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:26.56,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}个大满贯 她错过了{\fs78}3{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:28.65,TL,,0,0,0,,包括家门口的温网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.09,0:03:32.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The past 18 years I've done it every day,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N过去{\fs78}18{\fs68}年我每天都在打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:37.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and just not being able to do that,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N突然什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:41.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and just feeling so like I couldn't do the basic of things.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N连最基本的事都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:47.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I couldn't brush my teeth without almost standing back up and just being in agony.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刷牙都得马上直起腰 疼得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:49.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So it was definitely a tough injury,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这真的是一次难熬的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:54.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but it's definitely made me a stronger person,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但它让我变得更强大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.79,0:03:55.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a better person,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N变成更好的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:58.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and hopefully it'll make me a better tennis player.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N希望也让我成为更好的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:02.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I've been kind of good to go really from kind of US Open time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N其实美网时我就能复出了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:05.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Decided not to play that,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我决定不打
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:08.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to almost just put my body under a bit more stress.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让身体再多扛一些强度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:10.65,TL,,0,0,0,,她本可以早点回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:12.86,TL,,0,0,0,,可她说 受伤后最好的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:14.37,TL,,0,0,0,,是别着急
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.79,0:04:19.83,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月 她在比利 简 金杯总决赛复出
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:20.75,TL,,0,0,0,,到了武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:23.92,TL,,0,0,0,,她拿受伤前{\fs78}50{\fs68}多位的保护排名报名
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:25.79,TL,,0,0,0,,先赢卡利尼娜和本西奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:28.89,TL,,0,0,0,,又只用{\fs78}63{\fs68}分钟 送走了保利尼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:37.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's the first Briton ever to make the last four in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首位打进武汉半决赛的英国人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:39.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a story.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多好的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:44.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Out for six months this season,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个赛季停了六个月
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.69,0:04:49.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but now getting to the latter stages of the biggest of events.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在却打到了大赛的最后阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.20,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 对手两次发球胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:54.77,TL,,0,0,0,,两次都被她破回
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.77,0:04:57.29,TL,,0,0,0,,两盘都是先落后 再追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:04:59.12,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘抢七 {\fs78}11{\fs68}比{\fs78}9{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:00.97,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 又是抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.97,0:05:03.54,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}个盘点 她一个没给
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:09.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I was dreaming of playing this match when I was fully fit before the injury,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N受伤之前 我就梦想打这样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:13.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so to be able to come back here in my third event{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N复出第三站就能来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:17.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and to achieve this regardless is a huge milestone for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N做到这一步 对我是一座里程碑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:19.49,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛设立{\fs78}17{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.49,0:05:21.87,TL,,0,0,0,,她是排名最低的决赛选手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.87,0:05:23.29,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}18{\fs68}号的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:25.60,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是另一场半决赛的胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:26.60,TL,,0,0,0,,打完这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:28.60,TL,,0,0,0,,她会回到世界前{\fs78}50{\fs68}左右
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:30.51,TL,,0,0,0,,成为新的英国一姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:33.24,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}个月前 她疼得连刷牙都难
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:35.11,TL,,0,0,0,,伤好了 她没有急
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:37.51,TL,,0,0,0,,如果是你 你等得住吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:39.96,TL,,0,0,0,,这场决赛 你押她吗？
